# Formatting exclusions - files that must never be machine-rewritten.

# Frozen legacy DOM baselines: intentionally malformed/streaming artifacts
# (React flight markers, implied end tags). Rewriting them would break the
# parity gate's inputs, and they are never edited by humans.
tests/baseline/

# Vendored / third-party runtime asset served as-is.
public/web/images/preloader.html

# Narrative documents with deliberate prose line breaks.
PR.md

# EJS views. Prettier's EJS plugin cannot parse attribute-level EJS
# (<%- cond ? ' checked' : '' %>) or templates whose <html> lives in a
# partial, so these files are hand-formatted. `pnpm run check:views` guards
# their syntax.
src/views/
